  "title": "Masht-o Khiyaar (Persian Cucumber Salad with Sultanas and Walnuts)",
  "description": "This Persian cucumber salad combines cucumbers with toasted walnuts, sultanas, and a light dressing with yogurt, fresh dill, and fresh mint.",
  "authors": [
    "Afiyet_olson"
  ],
